  "title": "dsh harness adapter: first concrete Harness behind a neutral seam",
  "summary": "Adds a provider-neutral `harness` module (the `Harness`/`CommandRunner` traits, `CommandSpec`, `HarnessResult`, `HarnessCapabilities`, prompt and QUESTION-line helpers) plus an in-memory `fake` double, and the first concrete adapter, `dsh_harness`, which runs `dsh --profile headless --json -` through a `CommandRunner`, parses newline-delimited JSON events, and probes the binary's version, headless help and profile dump. The adapter refuses a dirty tree before starting, verifies the head commit did not move, and keeps the API key out of every git command.",
